{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/37a9eeb3187732a01efa2e677f268321.avif?t=1752430156\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A legend tells of a race of beings who could travel the stars like fish swimming through the ocean...Solaro takes you into the heart of a mysterious world, full of alien inhabitants and relics from a lost era. Master the art of solar navigation as you work your way through a vast labyrinth of puzzles and challenges, guided by the natural forces of the environment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/holu.gif?t=1752430156\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/de28f80346ccfc3f79b2c89f7c615419.avif?t=1752430156\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide a tiny traveller on an epic journey...across fiery lava worlds, frozen wastelands, alien forests, asteroid fields, neutron stars, and more. Along the way, you'll uncover cryptic clues pointing back to your own mysterious origins...Who are you? Where did you come from? And what could await you at the end of this long road through the vast darkness of uncharted space?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/ship.gif?t=1752430156\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/02c8a0f6c777f935c9d4085862b3b885.avif?t=1752430156\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solaro combines physics-based movement, conceptual puzzles, and sandbox-style exploration, for a diverse and experimental gameplay experience. Challenges range from slow, meditative puzzle solving to fast-paced trials that put your endurance to the test. Approach new levels freely in an open-world setting, and use your growing skills to tackle problems of increasing complexity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/dc45c3fa71e9bf7f362806eb0b2a17e8.avif?t=1752430156\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solaro was created by a self-taught solo developer over several years, and features original art, music, sound, and design. Experience a unique world, and a whole new point of view on space exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/c8a4ae5c53322e7b3eb2bd2264f90224.avif?t=1752430156\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ vibrant alien worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ unique &quot;orbital puzzles&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12+ hours of core gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12+ hours of optional features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ collectibles and achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2.5 hours of original music </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1602740?t=1752430156","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/87cd48f6196a1a750d99a72843fda0e351b69231/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752430156","capsule_image":"htt