did you come from? And what could await you at the end of this long road through the vast darkness of uncharted space?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/ship.gif?t=1752430156\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/02c8a0f6c777f935c9d4085862b3b885.avif?t=1752430156\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solaro combines physics-based movement, conceptual puzzles, and sandbox-style exploration, for a diverse and experimental gameplay experience. Challenges range from slow, meditative puzzle solving to fast-paced trials that put your endurance to the test. Approach new levels freely in an open-world setting, and use your growing skills to tackle problems of increasing complexity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/dc45c3fa71e9bf7f362806eb0b2a17e8.avif?t=1752430156\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solaro was created by a self-taught solo developer over several years, and features original art, music, sound, and design. Experience a unique world, and a whole new point of view on space exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/extras/c8a4ae5c53322e7b3eb2bd2264f90224.avif?t=1752430156\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ vibrant alien worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ unique &quot;orbital puzzles&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12+ hours of core gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12+ hours of optional features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ collectibles and achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2.5 hours of original music </p></li></ul>","developers":["3body Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602740/ba5c21ed5d18a64d921b24fa8671eb7f1e574f62/header.jpg?t=1752430156","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 3body Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.13 (High Sierra)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 4.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257119341,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119341/movie480.mp4?t=1743121747","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119341/movie_max.mp4?t=1743121747"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257119341/32fdd273579a068fcf21b8ce0ea4617e9f6cac61/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743121747","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119341/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743121747","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119341/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743121747"}}],"name":"Solaro","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating sys